    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_1gu0osr" name="Chameleon Doc" zeebe:modelerTemplate="io.camunda.connector.chameleon.ChameleonFunction" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/png;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="c-chameleon-function" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="0" target="sleep" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="errorSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="operationSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="documentSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="=&#34;&#34;" target="readDocumentName" />
          <zeebe:input source="docuHello" target="writeDocumentName" />
          <zeebe:input source="HelloInTheDocument" target="writeDocumentContent" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingTimeStampMS_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingIpAddress_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingMessage_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="documentWrite_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="operationValue_optional" />
          <zeebe:output source="= result.documentWrite" target="pingDocument" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
        <zeebe:taskHeaders>
          <zeebe:header key="resultVariable" value="result" />
          <zeebe:header key="errorExpression" value="if is defined(error) then bpmnError(error.code, error.message) else null" />
        </zeebe:taskHeaders>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_1nzvv77</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_1q30uuh</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_1kfyqb8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_0kjf9pe" name="Chameleon Ping" zeebe:modelerTemplate="io.camunda.connector.chameleon.ChameleonFunction" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/png;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="c-chameleon-function" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="throwErrors_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="operations_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="readDocumentName_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="writeDocumentName_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="writeDocumentContent_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="100" target="sleep" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="pingSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="Hello ping message" target="pingMessage" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="errorSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="operationSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="documentSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="pingTimeStampMS_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="pingIpAddress_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="pingMessage_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="documentWrite_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="operationValue_optional" />
          <zeebe:output source="= result.pingTimeStampMS" target="pingTimeStamp" />
          <zeebe:output source="= result.pingIpAddress" target="pingIpAddress" />
          <zeebe:output source="= result.pingMessage" target="pingMessage" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
        <zeebe:taskHeaders>
          <zeebe:header key="resultVariable" value="result" />
          <zeebe:header key="errorExpression" value="if is defined(error) then bpmnError(error.code, error.message) else null" />
        </zeebe:taskHeaders>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_0qzpd16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_1ugzg4p</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_0ty6qoa" name="Chameleon Set Variable" zeebe:modelerTemplate="io.camunda.connector.chameleon.ChameleonFunction" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/png;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="c-chameleon-function" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="0" target="sleep" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="errorSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="operationSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="=[ &#10;  {&#10;    &#34;%&#34;: 45,&#10;    &#34;data&#34;:&#10;    {&#10;      &#34;opIdAddressValue&#34;: &#34;pingIpAddress&#34;, &#10;      &#34;opConstantValueInt&#34;: 12, &#10;      &#34;opConstantValueSt&#34;: &#34;\&#34;hello the world\&#34;&#34;,&#10;      &#34;opDate&#34;:&#34;date()&#34;,&#10;      &#34;opDatetime&#34;: &#34;datetime()&#34;,&#10;      &#34;opLocalDate&#34;: &#34;localdate()&#34;,&#10;      &#34;oplocaltime&#34;: &#34;localtime()&#34;,&#10;      &#34;zonedatetime&#34;: &#34;zoneddatetime()&#34; }&#10;   },&#10;   {&#10;     &#34;%&#34;: 15,&#10;     &#34;data&#34;:&#10;     {&#10;       &#34;opIdAddressValue&#34;: &#34;\&#34;The value for this part\&#34;&#34;, &#10;       &#34;opConstantValueInt&#34;: 45 &#10;     }&#10;  }&#10;]" target="operations" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="documentSimulation" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingTimeStampMS_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingIpAddress_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="pingMessage_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="false" target="documentWrite_optional" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="operationValue_optional" />
          <zeebe:output source="= result.operationValue" target="opValue" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
        <zeebe:taskHeaders>
          <zeebe:header key="resultVariable" value="result" />
          <zeebe:header key="errorExpression" value="if is defined(error) then bpmnError(error.code, error.message) else null" />
        </zeebe:taskHeaders>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_1ugzg4p</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_0euugq1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_0k09tf2" name="Chameleon Errors" zeebe:modelerTemplate="io.camunda.connector.chameleon.ChameleonFunction" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/png;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="c-chameleon-function" />
